'''Holy Valkyrie Cat''' (ネコヴァルキリー・聖, ''Neko Varukirī・Hijiri'', '''Cat Valkyrie - Saint''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in [[Valkyrie Cat's Trial]]. She is the second enemy version of [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie Cat]], the first being [[Corrupted Valkyrie]]. She was added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Holy Valkyrie Cat
|image = E 716.png
|appearance = [[Valkyrie Cat's Trial]]
|money drop = 2,222¢ - 8,776¢
}}

==Enemy==
Being the enemy variant of your own [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie]], this enemy shares a lot of similarities. Most notably, the freeze. However, instead of a 35% chance, this Valkyrie has a 75% chance, meaning you should expect non-freeze immune units that get outranged to be permanently frozen. However, she only has a range of 350, meaning any high-ranged units can outrange her easily. She also has quite the bulk and attack power, which doubles at half health. To balance this out, Valk has a four second attack delay. She also has a lot of knockbacks, 12 to be exact, which allows for the player to easily push her into the range of the Sunfish Jones present in the same stage. Furthermore, her long attack delay allows for her to push up and make you lose ground.

